[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Presented below are water quality standards that are in effect for Clean Water Act purposes.",
        "bbox": [
            112,
            109,
            882,
            160
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "EPA is posting these standards as a convenience to users and has made a reasonable effort to assure their accuracy. Additionally, EPA has made a reasonable effort to identify parts of the standards that are not approved, disapproved, or are otherwise not in effectfor Clean Water Act purposes.",
